<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699' }}>02 改成什么样</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3864', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>配额靠三层执行点兜住</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#3D4C63' }}>没有任何一个执行点能独自兜住全部约束。三层叠加，每层管住自己看得见的那一段。</Text>

        <svg width={1160} height={355} viewBox='0 0 1100 337.09'>
            <rect x='0' y='0' width='350' height='263.35' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D9DEE7' strokeWidth='1' />
            <rect x='0' y='0' width='350' height='46.35' fill='#7A8699' />
            <text x='20' y='30.55' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold' fill='#FFFFFF' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>① 网关 · 软限流</text>
            <text x='20' y='88.49' fontSize='22' fontWeight='bold' fill='#3D4C63' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>限流与计量</text>
            <line x1='20' y1='103.23' x2='330' y2='103.23' stroke='#D9DEE7' strokeWidth='1' />
            <text x='20' y='132.73' fontSize='15' fill='#7A8699' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>位置</text>
            <text x='96' y='132.73' fontSize='15' fill='#3D4C63' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>所有入口流量</text>
            <text x='20' y='162.22' fontSize='15' fill='#7A8699' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>管什么</text>
            <text x='96' y='162.22' fontSize='15' fill='#3D4C63' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>调用次数、Token、并发</text>
            <text x='20' y='191.72' fontSize='15' fill='#7A8699' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>超限后</text>
            <text x='96' y='191.72' fontSize='15' fill='#3D4C63' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>429 + 降级提示</text>
            <rect x='20' y='210.68' width='310' height='33.71' fill='#F2F5F9' />
            <text x='30' y='232.8' fontSize='14' fontWeight='bold' fill='#3D4C63' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>软 —— 可协商，也可临时放宽</text>

            <rect x='375' y='0' width='350' height='263.35' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D9DEE7' strokeWidth='1' />
            <rect x='375' y='0' width='350' height='46.35' fill='#2E6DA4' />
            <text x='395' y='30.55' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold' fill='#FFFFFF' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>② 准入校验 · 准硬</text>
            <text x='395' y='88.49' fontSize='22' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F3864' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>创建前拦截</text>
            <line x1='395' y1='103.23' x2='705' y2='103.23' stroke='#D9DEE7' strokeWidth='1' />
            <text x='395' y='132.73' fontSize='15' fill='#7A8699' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>位置</text>
            <text x='471' y='132.73' fontSize='15' fill='#3D4C63' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>创建 / 变更资源时</text>
            <text x='395' y='162.22' fontSize='15' fill='#7A8699' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>管什么</text>
            <text x='471' y='162.22' fontSize='15' fill='#3D4C63' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>命名、配额余量、镜像白名单</text>
            <text x='395' y='191.72' fontSize='15' fill='#7A8699' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>超限后</text>
            <text x='471' y='191.72' fontSize='15' fill='#3D4C63' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>拒绝创建并返回原因</text>
            <rect x='395' y='210.68' width='310' height='33.71' fill='#F2F5F9' />
            <text x='405' y='232.8' fontSize='14' fontWeight='bold' fill='#3D4C63' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>准硬 —— 得配合审计防绕过</text>

            <rect x='750' y='0' width='350' height='263.35' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D9DEE7' strokeWidth='1' />
            <rect x='750' y='0' width='350' height='46.35' fill='#1F3864' />
            <text x='770' y='30.55' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold' fill='#FFFFFF' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>③ K8s 配额 · 硬</text>
            <text x='770' y='88.49' fontSize='22' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F3864' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>运行时封顶</text>
            <line x1='770' y1='103.23' x2='1080' y2='103.23' stroke='#D9DEE7' strokeWidth='1' />
            <text x='770' y='132.73' fontSize='15' fill='#7A8699' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>位置</text>
            <text x='846' y='132.73' fontSize='15' fill='#3D4C63' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>资源实际分配</text>
            <text x='770' y='162.22' fontSize='15' fill='#7A8699' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>管什么</text>
            <text x='846' y='162.22' fontSize='15' fill='#3D4C63' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>CPU、内存、存储、Pod 数</text>
            <text x='770' y='191.72' fontSize='15' fill='#7A8699' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>超限后</text>
            <text x='846' y='191.72' fontSize='15' fill='#3D4C63' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>Pending、驱逐、OOM</text>
            <rect x='770' y='210.68' width='310' height='33.71' fill='#F2F5F9' />
            <text x='780' y='232.8' fontSize='14' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F3864' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>硬 —— 内核层执行，绕不过去</text>

            <rect x='0' y='286.52' width='6' height='50.56' fill='#1F3864' />
            <rect x='6' y='286.52' width='1094' height='50.56' fill='#F2F5F9' />
            <text x='26' y='318.13' fontSize='15' fill='#3D4C63' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>K8s 只看得见资源，看不见调用次数、Token 与并发用户——这三类量必须在网关计量，所以网关是 P0 的第一个里程碑。</text>
        </svg>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', background: '#1F3864', padding: 16, gap: 12 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>结论</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>配额不是一张表，是三个执行点各自算得出来、各自拦得住——缺一层，账就记不清。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699' }}>三层配额用同一套指标口径，差异只体现在“什么时候拦”</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699' }}>15 / 20</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
